PRINTFORMW 「W-Wait!」
PRINTFORMDW When you try to push her down, Kagerou grabs your arm with tremendous strength.
PRINTFORMDW You immediately stop what you're doing, and the two of you just look at each other for a moment.
PRINTFORMW 「Uhmmmー... This is important, so let me tell you something!」
PRINTFORMW 「Wellー... Iー..」
PRINTFORMW 「Me too, %CALLNAME:MASTER%. I've actually been wanting you for a really long time now.」
PRINTFORMW 「You and I are a youkai and a human, our cultures and lifestyles are totally different.」
PRINTFORMW 「I think it's really fun to be with you, I've learned so many new things, and my life's getting better in a lot of ways.」
PRINTFORMW 「But... You only have a few decades left to live, right?」
PRINTFORMW 「Well, as just a weak little beast youkai, I don't actually know how long I can make it for... But let's leave that aside for now.」
PRINTFORMW 「Anyway, for whatever time we have, I want to be able to spend as much of that precious time with you as I can.」
PRINTFORMW 「That's why, I want you to join with me, become a family, make children, so that our time together becomes irreplaceable!」
PRINTFORMW 「%CALLNAME:MASTER%, would you like to spend the rest of your precious time with me?」
